<Window x:Class="SS14_MIDI_IDE.ChangelogWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Changelog"
        Icon="pack://application:,,,/mothroach.ico"
        Height="500" Width="600"
        Background="#1e1e1e"
        Foreground="White"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        ResizeMode="NoResize"
        WindowStyle="None"
        AllowsTransparency="True">
    
    <Border CornerRadius="5" Background="#2d2d30" Padding="10">
        <Grid>
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
            
            <!-- Header -->
            <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Height="30" Background="#3e3e42" MouseLeftButtonDown="Header_MouseLeftButtonDown">
                <TextBlock Text="Changelog" Foreground="White" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0" FontWeight="Bold"/>
                <Button Width="30" Height="30" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,5,0" Click="CloseButton_Click" Foreground="White">
                    <Button.Template>
                        <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                            <Border Name="border" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="3">
                                <Path Name="icon" Data="M 0,0 L 10,10 M 10,0 L 0,10" Stroke="#999" StrokeThickness="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                            </Border>
                            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                                <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                    <Setter TargetName="border" Property="Background" Value="#e81123"/>
                                    <Setter TargetName="icon" Property="Stroke" Value="White"/>
                                </Trigger>
                            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        </ControlTemplate>
                    </Button.Template>
                </Button>
            </DockPanel>
            
            <!-- Content -->
            <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,15,0,0" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                <StackPanel Margin="10,0,10,10">
                    
                    <TextBlock Text="Version History" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="20" Foreground="White" Margin="0,0,0,20"/>
                    
                    <TextBlock Text="v0.14.3" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="16" Foreground="#007acc" Margin="0,0,0,5"/>
                    <TextBlock Foreground="#d4d4d4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="10,0,0,15" LineHeight="20">
• Fixed instrument assignments for multi-channel tracks (correctly maps channels like track 2 in multi-channel MIDIs).<LineBreak/>
• Drastically improved tracker view rendering performance (bypasses heavy layout rebuilds during scroll updates).<LineBreak/>
• Added a thematic success dialog indicating the boost percentage when maximizing volume.<LineBreak/>
• Implemented full project saving/loading using the new .mmp (MidiMaster Project) unified format.<LineBreak/>
• Fixed a bug where MIDI data was not properly sent to the AudioEngine upon loading a project.<LineBreak/>
• Reference Audio is now bundled directly inside the .mmp project file so projects are fully self-contained.
                    </TextBlock>
                    
                    <TextBlock Text="v0.13" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="16" Foreground="#007acc" Margin="0,0,0,5"/>
                    <TextBlock Foreground="#d4d4d4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="10,0,0,15" LineHeight="20">
• Fixed crash when importing FTM modules with expansion instruments.<LineBreak/>
• Added Instrument Editor with visual macro graphs.<LineBreak/>
• VRC6 instruments now parsed correctly.<LineBreak/>
• Improved support for FamiTracker macros.
                    </TextBlock>
                    
                    <TextBlock Text="v0.12" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="16" Foreground="#007acc" Margin="0,0,0,5"/>
                    <TextBlock Foreground="#d4d4d4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="10,0,0,15" LineHeight="20">
• Initial integration of MeltySynth and Vorbis sample rendering.<LineBreak/>
• Basic tracker visualization added.<LineBreak/>
• GeneralUser GS SoundFont implemented as default audio bank.
                    </TextBlock>
                    
                    <TextBlock Text="v0.1" FontWeight="Bold" FontSize="16" Foreground="#007acc" Margin="0,0,0,5"/>
                    <TextBlock Foreground="#d4d4d4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="10,0,0,15" LineHeight="20">
• Initial prototype release of MidiMaster.<LineBreak/>
• Basic MIDI playback capabilities.
                    </TextBlock>
                    
                </StackPanel>
            </ScrollViewer>
        </Grid>
    </Border>
</Window>
